      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/zaheer-iqbal-on-his-acting-journey-i-want-to-do-different-characters-and-good-scripts-and-i-dont-look-at-anything-else/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
