       <h1>Ayushmann Khurrana and Tahira Kashyap Host Star-Studded Diwali Bash</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actors Ayushmann Khurrana and Tahira Kashyap hosted a grand Diwali party at their Mumbai residence for friends and industry colleagues. The guest list featured numerous Bollywood figures, including Karan Johar, Sara Ali Khan, Arjun Kapoor, and Rajkummar Rao, to celebrate the festival.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-24/ayushmann-khurrana-and-tahira-kashyap-host-star-studded-diwa.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The celebration coincided with the October 23, 2026, theatrical release of 'Udta Teer,' a spy-comedy starring Khurrana and Sara Ali Khan. Directed by Akash A. Kaushik, the film is produced by a team including Karan Johar and Guneet Monga Kapoor. Tahira Kashyap shared social media highlights of the event, which lasted until early morning.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the social event and the film details as provided in the source text.</p>
