       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-24 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>BJP leader R Ashoka attacks Congress over Siddaramaiah sting operation allegations</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Senior BJP leader R Ashoka has criticized the Congress party following allegations by Yathindra Siddaramaiah that his own party members orchestrated a sting operation against his father, former Karnataka Chief Minister Siddaramaiah. Ashoka condemned the Karnataka Pradesh Congress Committee, labeling it a &quot;mafia syndicate&quot; and targeting Rahul Gandhi’s &quot;Mohabbat ki Dukaan&quot; slogan.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-24/bjp-leader-r-ashoka-attacks-congress-over-siddaramaiah-sting.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The political row follows the appearance of YouTube videos containing allegations against the former Chief Minister, which led to a legal injunction and police complaint. Ashoka accused the state government of paralysis and internal blackmail, claiming the administration is failing to manage the ongoing controversy.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately captures the political tension and specific accusations made by R Ashoka.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/siddaramaiah-sting-operation-r-ashoka-attacks-karnataka-congress-ptag-3024196-2026-10-24?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
