       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-24 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kartik Aaryan supports Luv Ranjan’s new film Pehla Pyaar Doosri Baar</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kartik Aaryan has publicly expressed support for filmmaker Luv Ranjan’s new romantic comedy, Pehla Pyaar Doosri Baar, which recently premiered in theaters. Aaryan shared a nostalgic Instagram message honoring his long-standing professional relationship with Ranjan, who directed his 2011 debut film, Pyaar Ka Punchnama.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-24/kartik-aaryan-supports-luv-ranjans-new-film-pehla-pyaar-doos.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Anuj Saini and produced by Luv Films, the movie features an ensemble cast including Sparsh Walia and Alisha Chopra. The film explores themes of first love and friendship among a group of friends. Aaryan’s shoutout highlighted their early career collaboration while wishing the new production team success.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief correctly identifies the support expressed by Aaryan and provides context on the film's production.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/kartik-aaryan-cheers-for-luv-ranjans-pehla-pyaar-doosri-baar-with-a-nostalgic-message/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
