      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/companies/quarterly-results/kotak-mahindra-bank-q2-fy27-profit-nii-fcnr-deposits-asset-quality-126102400637_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
