       <h1>Varun Dhawan and Janhvi Kapoor appear on Koffee With Karan 9</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Varun Dhawan and Janhvi Kapoor are the featured guests on the third episode of the final season of Koffee With Karan. The promotional teaser shows the duo engaging in playful banter and revealing past tensions with host Karan Johar, with Arjun Kapoor joining as a surprise guest to add to the high-energy exchanges.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-24/varun-dhawan-and-janhvi-kapoor-appear-on-koffee-with-karan-9.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The promo highlights include Janhvi performing an impromptu dance, a trivia buzzer challenge, and a rapid-fire round where Varun seeks advice from Arjun Kapoor. The episode promises a mix of industry gossip and candid moments, continuing the show's tradition of vibrant celebrity interactions.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately reports the promo details and guest appearances mentioned in the source.</p>
